{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"immense-feedable-weevil","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Finding (audit of epic 3405-c0b7)\n**Site:** `src/rebar/_reads.py:99` sets `err.error_code = \"pinned_ticket_read_failed\"`, returned verbatim by `error_code_for` branch 5 (the `exc.error_code` passthrough). But `pinned_ticket_read_failed` is NOT a member of `KNOWN_ERROR_CODES` (`src/rebar/_errors.py:48-66`).\n\n**Problem:** the code itself is descriptive (NOT misleading). The defect is a vocabulary-completeness gap: `error_code_for`'s own docstring says it \"Returns a stable vocabulary code (one of KNOWN_ERROR_CODES)\", but this passthrough emits a code outside that set. Any consumer that validates the returned code against `KNOWN_ERROR_CODES` (the documented contract) would reject a legitimately-emitted code, or fall back to treating it as unknown.\n\n**Observable vs latent:** OBSERVABLE — emitted on the pinned-ticket read failure path; reaches the MCP envelope guard and the CLI reader envelope.\n\n**Proposed fix — READY-TO-FIX (reuse existing, no design decision):** add `\"pinned_ticket_read_failed\"` to the `KNOWN_ERROR_CODES` frozenset so the emitted vocabulary and the declared vocabulary agree. (Alternatively, add a contract test that asserts every `err.error_code` string assigned in the tree is a member of `KNOWN_ERROR_CODES` — see the epic's prevention recommendation.) Low priority; not misleading, but it violates the stated vocabulary contract.\n\n**caused_by / class:** vocabulary drift, not the `llm_unavailable` pattern.","id":"0aee-a70d-045b-48a1","parent_id":"3405-c0b7-0436-4b46","priority":2,"tags":["error-taxonomy","ready-to-fix"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"pinned_ticket_read_failed is emitted but absent from KNOWN_ERROR_CODES (vocabulary-contract gap)"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788056673183653005,"uuid":"2116e582-cc91-4209-a168-8d2a8868d1c0"}